Subject: [PATCH 07/10] powershare: Add a HAL for reverse wireless charging

Toggle the charger driver's reverse charging mode through Lineage's
PowerShare interface, which backs the battery share tile.

Change-Id: I81fbdc42b9869fed37fa70736f7f49d8a97b7534
